  "content": "你好，请问您需要翻译什么文本呢？![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png) \n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">&nbsp;适用于 Forge 1.16.5、1.18.2、1.19.2、1.20.1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\">以及 NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p>  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>必要模组：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Integrated API</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">机械动力（Create）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">夸克（Quark）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">补充（Supplementaries）</span></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>可选集成模组：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes O’ Plenty</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Alex 的生物（Alex’s Mobs）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Guard Villagers</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Artifacts</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biomes You'll Go</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Regions Unexplored</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Terralith</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Waystones</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">农夫乐事（Farmer's Delight）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冰与火（Ice and Fire）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ars Nouveau</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Archeology</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\">![](https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg)</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #800080;\"><strong><strong>什么是集成地下城与结构？</strong></strong></span></h2> \n\n    <span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 集成地下城与结构（简称 IDAS）是一个模组，它使用来自夸克、Alex 的生物和机械动力的方块与生物，添加了细节极其丰富的结构，并且可选集成许多其他模组。我厌倦了在整合包中安装结构模组后探索世界，却只发现原版物品且毫无难度可言。我喜爱精心建造的建筑和机械动力的机器，因此决定制作一个模组，正是为了弥补我一直以来所缺失的体验。美丽且富有挑战性的地下城与结构，充满了故事背景，并完全集成到多个核心 Forge 模组中。</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;\">如果你是第一次接触这个模组，我强烈建议你先找到并体验一下迷宫、工匠工坊、远古矿井或掠夺者堡垒。这些建筑耗费了我最长的建造时间，并且我认为它们玩起来真的非常有趣且回报丰厚。祝你好运！</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>来看看我的其他项目！</strong></span>\n\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，集成结构系列的官方整合包</strong></span>\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a><br></strong></span>\n*   <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #800080;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></strong></span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>配置与可选集成：</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>对于 1.16 版本</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">编辑配置文件。<br>IDAS 会自动检测是否安装了冰与火模组，并会改变一些结构的战利品和生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br><strong>对于 1.18 及以上版本</strong><br>要启用 BOP 集成，请下载此 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #36f; text-decoration: underline;\">数据包</span></span></a>。<br>要启用 Alex 的生物集成，请下载此 <span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要配置其他任何内容，请下载此 <span style=\"color: #36f;\"><a style=\"color: #36f;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span>。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要更改生成率，修改结构集（structure sets）中的 spacing（间隔）和 separation（分离）值。Spacing 是两次相邻生成尝试之间的平均距离，值范围为 0 到 4096。Separation 是两次相邻生成尝试之间在区块中的最小距离，值范围为 0 到 4096，且不能大于 spacing。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要编辑生物群系，修改位于 tags/worldgen/biome/has structure 中的生物群系文件。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要禁用结构，移除其标签列表中的所有生物群系，或者将 separation 和 spacing 设置为极高的数字。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">要提高与其他结构模组的兼容性，请在每个 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 文件的“structure set to avoid”（要避免的结构集）列表中添加结构。</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>当使用全局数据包模组时，如果你同时使用 BOP 和配置数据包，必须手动确保用于 BOP 集成的数据包位于配置数据包上方。</span></p></div>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>现有功能与计划功能：</strong></strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>在主世界和下界维度中有超过 50 个独特的、细节极其丰富的结构，包括：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 20 个独特的小型且细节丰富的世界建筑结构，例如露营地、市场、动物巢穴等。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 7 个终局级别的地下城，从广阔的矮人矿井到沙漠迷宫，再到掠夺者堡垒。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 机械动力的主题地下城，带有旋转式死亡陷阱，例如工匠工坊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 15 个为疲惫旅人准备的独特房屋和旅馆。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;- 6 个可供探索的魔法师和附魔高塔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 沉没的海盗船。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 村民城堡。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 可探索的魔法塔和下界传送门。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp; 基于事件的结构，例如冬季马车和鬼宅。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>计划功能：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 地下城变种。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 更多下界和末地结构。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-&nbsp;<strong>加入我的 Discord 以提出建议，并投票决定接下来添加哪些结构！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #800080;\"><strong>如果你在寻找某个结构时遇到麻烦，只需在聊天中输入 `<em>/locate idas</em>`，你应该能找到一个包含所有结构的列表。例如，输入 `<em>/locate idas:castle</em>` 会定位到你附近最近的城堡。</strong></span></p></div>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>所有结构图片</strong></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>宏伟迷宫，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>掠夺者堡垒，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>远古矿井，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>巫师塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>附魔塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>废弃房屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>城堡，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>砖房，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>小屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鬼屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>&nbsp;熊爪旅馆，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>沉船，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>猎人小屋，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>农舍，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>女巫树桩，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>隐士空洞，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>药剂师之家，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>渔民小屋，由 Nirze 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>红角公会，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>养蜂人的房子，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>树梢酒馆，由 Howester1984 和 chloe2cu 设计</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>远古传送门，由 CraisinLord 和 Nirze 设计</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>工匠工坊，由 CraisinLord 和 Howester1984 设计</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>死灵法师尖塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>集市，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>鬼宅，由 Howester1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬季马车，由 Howester1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong>不祥恐惧堡垒，由 CraisinLord 设计（仅限冰与火模组）</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><strong><br>枢纽，由 Codex 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此结构中的传送门通往：<br></strong></strong></span></p><div><div><div><p>天境（Aether）</p><p>暮色森林（Twilight Forest）</p><p>Atum</p><p>下界（Nether）</p><p>Erebus/地下花园（Undergarden）</p><p>Bumblezone</p><p>伊甸之环（Eden ring）</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>深海遗迹，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" heigh